Title:  As close to a perfect song

Seq:    6.42.1.1

Level:  5 - Detail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Pelecanos, George P|George P Pelecanos]],    Apr 2003, from the article "[["Thunder Road" in Uncut magazine (Pelecanos)]]"


Body:

One of the great rock’n roll performances, and as close to a perfect song as anyone’s ever recorded.
